Copyright Anthropic, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes from the upstream plugin:
- Autodesk Fusion, the upstream plugin's one CAD connector, is replaced by a different
  CAD system (SOLIDWORKS, Onshape or SolidCraft, per edition) through a bridge in servers/.
- Text in the skills that named Fusion is changed to the edition's CAD system. The
  bridge builds estimating models, imports STEP files and varies existing models;
  CAM, which the edition's CAD system offers no published API or module for, is marked
  as not available, with the feature-path fallback the upstream plugin already defines.
- The changes are made by tools/cad-variants/build.py in the fork that carries this folder.

